      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": null,
      "text": "For production I'd use Google Cloud (ADR 5, not deployed). Events and facts would go in Cloud SQL, with reading and\nanswering on Cloud Run and Vertex AI. Your private side would be locked so nothing in it can send data out. Your phone reads\nit only when signed in.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For production I'd use Google Cloud (ADR 5, not deployed). Events and facts would go in Cloud SQL, with reading and\nanswering on Cloud Run and Vertex AI. Your private side would be locked so nothing in it can send data out. Your phone reads\nit only when signed in.",
